WEBVTT

00:00:00.680 --> 00:00:03.250
When I grow up, I want to be Prime Minister!

00:00:03.610 --> 00:00:06.500
I'll make sure everyone can keep smiling!

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:08.580
That's a big dream.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.120
Anyone else want to share?

00:00:10.140 --> 00:00:11.720
Dreams, huh?

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:13.840
I'm still not sure.

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.760
But it's cool that you've already picked one, Hishikawa.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:17.300
Huh?

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.300
Being a doctor, right?

00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:19.530
Since your mom's one.

00:00:19.830 --> 00:00:21.550
Well, she is...

00:00:22.180 --> 00:00:23.350
<i>Hm?</i>

00:00:23.350 --> 00:00:28.460
<i>Did I want to be a doctor because my mom was one?</i>

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:29.010
{OP}

00:00:30.850 --> 00:00:35.220
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:37.690
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:38.050 --> 00:00:40.560
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:42.590
Every day it sparkles

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:46.290
Dokidoki Precure

00:00:47.760 --> 00:00:53.170
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:00:53.770 --> 00:00:58.830
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:04.480
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:05.010 --> 00:01:09.920
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:15.610
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:15.820 --> 00:01:24.500
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:24.490 --> 00:01:26.170
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:26.170 --> 00:01:28.570
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:31.410
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:31.670 --> 00:01:34.220
What's more than just cute

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:38.080
is our promise between girls

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:44.120
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:50.020
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:01:54.330 --> 00:01:56.000
Prime Minister?

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:58.530
It's quite like you.

00:01:58.530 --> 00:02:00.360
Aw, shucks...

00:02:00.690 --> 00:02:02.630
And Rikka wants to be a doctor?

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:03.470
Huh?

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:05.390
Yeah...

00:02:06.970 --> 00:02:08.700
What, you don't?

00:02:08.700 --> 00:02:10.530
Maybe...

00:02:10.530 --> 00:02:12.620
Maybe I don't...

00:02:13.590 --> 00:02:15.040
What do you mean?

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:19.980
Well, I always thought I wanted to be a doctor...

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:25.530
but maybe that was just because I admired my mom.

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:30.270
In other words, it wasn't your true desire.

00:02:31.010 --> 00:02:32.170
Aguri? {Yeah, why does she have to be a cunt and eat away from everyone else?}

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:34.140
Why are you here?

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:39.780
Long ago, I was drawn to this shop by the harmony of dumplings, gelatin, and brown sugar that is this dish,

00:02:39.770 --> 00:02:42.150
and I've been a regular ever since.

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.750
Bravo!

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:50.150
What did you mean by "it wasn't my true desire"?

00:02:50.140 --> 00:02:53.320
Shouldn't you find the answer to that yourself?

00:02:54.810 --> 00:02:58.530
Regardless, it seems your heart is wavering.

00:02:59.010 --> 00:03:00.960
This is an excellent opportunity.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:04.160
If you wish to find your true feelings,

00:03:04.520 --> 00:03:07.140
perhaps you should fret over it until you reach them? {とことん
なやんでみては　いかがですか？}

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:09.720
My true feelings...

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:21.010
How Do You Really Feel?

00:03:16.410 --> 00:03:21.010
How Do You Really Feel?

00:03:25.170 --> 00:03:27.130
They're baby biscuits!

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:31.390
Cure Ace sure is a mystery.

00:03:32.120 --> 00:03:34.990
I still don't know what goes through her head.

00:03:34.990 --> 00:03:40.080
But it's true that we all grew stronger thanks to her.

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.130
I suppose.

00:03:43.140 --> 00:03:45.230
Are you still worried about earlier?

00:03:45.230 --> 00:03:45.880
Huh?

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:47.340
No, I'm fine.

00:03:47.340 --> 00:03:51.070
Besides, today's the first time Dad's been home in three months!

00:03:51.480 --> 00:03:53.390
Mom's getting off early, too!

00:03:53.390 --> 00:03:56.550
So tonight will be your first family dinner in a while, huh?

00:03:56.870 --> 00:03:57.720
Yeah!

00:03:57.720 --> 00:03:59.000
Well, see ya!

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:05.910
What was that for?!

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.260
Whoops, I thought you were a stray cat.

00:04:09.700 --> 00:04:11.030
That's a load!

00:04:11.030 --> 00:04:14.130
It's what you get for bargin' into our hideout!

00:04:14.130 --> 00:04:16.330
No, this is <i>our</i> hideout!

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:19.690
But we've taken it for ourselves, remember?

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.710
Cripes, yer annoyin'!

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:23.740
Lemme go!

00:04:24.670 --> 00:04:26.820
Strike!

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:30.290
Those jerks!

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:33.760
No, <i>you</i> shut up, stupid thunder!

00:04:47.190 --> 00:04:48.210
Hello?

00:04:48.210 --> 00:04:49.130
Oh, Mommy?

00:04:49.450 --> 00:04:50.800
What's up?

00:04:50.800 --> 00:04:51.860
Yeah.

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:52.640
Huh?

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:54.750
Oh...

00:04:55.350 --> 00:04:56.250
I see.

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.690
Don't worry.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.930
If it's for your patients, go ahead.

00:05:00.930 --> 00:05:01.590
Huh?

00:05:02.410 --> 00:05:03.520
Daddy too?

00:05:03.970 --> 00:05:06.840
No, this always happens.

00:05:06.840 --> 00:05:08.520
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:05:09.300 --> 00:05:11.000
Okay, bye.

00:05:13.590 --> 00:05:16.250
Your mom isn't coming home tonight?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:18.780
No. Neither is Dad.

00:05:18.780 --> 00:05:20.980
His flight got canceled.

00:05:20.980 --> 00:05:23.310
That's... too bad.

00:05:24.460 --> 00:05:25.950
It's nothing new.

00:05:30.610 --> 00:05:31.330
Gotcha!

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:36.230
What's the long face for, Rachel?

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.220
Oh yeah!

00:05:37.560 --> 00:05:39.230
Get ready, Rachel!

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:41.290
Tomorrow, you're going on a date with me!

00:06:00.990 --> 00:06:02.390
Watch it!

00:06:02.390 --> 00:06:04.260
But why the beach?

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:04.960
Huh?

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:09.690
Oh... no reason.

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:13.230
I just thought it'd be nice.

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:26.920
Like a driven wave, dashed by fierce winds on a rock am I.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:29.930
Crushed and all alone, thinking over what has been.

00:06:30.770 --> 00:06:32.400
Was that from the Hundred Poets?

00:06:32.400 --> 00:06:33.370
Yeah.

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:37.860
It's the poem of a troubled girl who watches the waves crash on the rocks.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:42.390
Are you troubled too?

00:06:48.680 --> 00:06:52.250
I think it really was just because I admired Mom.

00:06:52.950 --> 00:06:56.970
Looking back, I became a Precure and joined the student council

00:06:56.970 --> 00:07:00.130
because I'd be with Mana.

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:05.340
In the end, everything I've done has been out of admiration of someone else.

00:07:08.430 --> 00:07:13.410
So I can't help but wonder where my true feelings lie.

00:07:14.350 --> 00:07:17.860
What do I want in life?

00:07:19.480 --> 00:07:20.560
That's...

00:07:20.840 --> 00:07:23.370
something nobody knows but you.

00:07:24.760 --> 00:07:26.030
Maybe.

00:07:30.700 --> 00:07:31.370
Huh?

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:32.830
Whoah!

00:07:32.830 --> 00:07:33.780
Rikka!

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:38.620
Oh no!

00:07:40.040 --> 00:07:41.510
Are you all right?

00:07:42.290 --> 00:07:43.140
It's...

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:45.020
Ira!

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.600
W-Why is he here?

00:07:48.600 --> 00:07:50.130
And he's hurt, too—

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:52.780
Don't get close! He's dangerous!

00:07:52.780 --> 00:07:55.850
Huh? But we can't leave him like this!

00:07:56.280 --> 00:07:57.770
What should I do?

00:07:57.770 --> 00:07:59.230
Should I...

00:08:04.850 --> 00:08:06.860
Worrying won't get us anywhere!

00:08:17.360 --> 00:08:18.720
He's awake!

00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:20.540
Rikka, let's run!

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:22.990
H-Huh? But...

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:24.350
Did you...

00:08:24.880 --> 00:08:26.550
save my life?

00:08:27.420 --> 00:08:29.220
Thank you so much.

00:08:29.560 --> 00:08:32.060
But what was I...

00:08:33.380 --> 00:08:36.040
No, first off...

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:37.670
<i>Who</i> am I?

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:40.730
Then you...

00:08:41.420 --> 00:08:42.810
No way...

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:45.220
have amnesia?

00:08:46.340 --> 00:08:48.620
Where am— ow!

00:08:48.620 --> 00:08:50.620
Oh, don't move!

00:08:50.880 --> 00:08:52.550
You're injured.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:55.900
Thank you.

00:08:55.900 --> 00:08:56.990
You're kind.

00:08:56.980 --> 00:08:57.900
Huh?!

00:09:10.580 --> 00:09:13.040
Should we really do this?

00:09:13.630 --> 00:09:16.340
Is there anything I could do to help?

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:19.190
Patients only need to worry about their injuries.

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:23.680
I can't make them as well as Mana's dad doe—

00:09:24.710 --> 00:09:25.410
Watch out!

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:31.390
Rikka!

00:09:33.410 --> 00:09:35.240
Sorry. Is everything all right?

00:09:35.240 --> 00:09:36.090
Yeah...

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:38.130
just look...

00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:40.620
Not those, I mean you!

00:09:40.620 --> 00:09:42.060
I'll... manage.

00:09:42.320 --> 00:09:43.280
Phew.

00:09:43.280 --> 00:09:45.540
If you're fine, then I am, too.

00:09:46.920 --> 00:09:48.710
You're like an angel...

00:09:48.700 --> 00:09:49.910
Huh?!

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:55.240
Are you glued together or something?!

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:00.220
Sorry...

00:10:00.220 --> 00:10:01.200
Don't worry...

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:04.050
Dinner time!

00:10:07.290 --> 00:10:08.920
Does it hurt?

00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:12.200
You're injured, so you have to be careful!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:13.940
Thanks.

00:10:13.940 --> 00:10:15.530
You're pretty kind, too.

00:10:15.530 --> 00:10:16.170
Huh?

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:20.530
It's probably hard to eat with those injuries.

00:10:20.530 --> 00:10:22.300
Rachel, give me that spoon.

00:10:22.580 --> 00:10:23.350
Sure.

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:24.830
Thanks.

00:10:24.830 --> 00:10:26.310
Now, face me.

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:28.690
N-No, I can do it myself...

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:30.390
You couldn't before!

00:10:30.390 --> 00:10:31.860
So don't be shy.

00:10:31.860 --> 00:10:33.650
I-I don't think I should...

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:37.940
Geez! I don't care how injured he is, he's getting too pampered!

00:10:37.940 --> 00:10:39.260
Rachel!

00:10:39.250 --> 00:10:41.800
Charles, Lance, why are you here?!

00:10:41.800 --> 00:10:45.540
We figured you'd be free since Rikka's family was home, so...

00:10:45.540 --> 00:10:47.180
we came to hang out!

00:10:47.180 --> 00:10:48.610
R-Really?

00:10:48.610 --> 00:10:50.210
What're you freaked out over?

00:10:50.210 --> 00:10:51.430
I'm not freaking out!

00:10:51.430 --> 00:10:52.680
Did something happen?

00:10:52.680 --> 00:10:54.140
Nothing at all!

00:10:54.140 --> 00:10:55.150
I don't buy it!

00:10:55.150 --> 00:10:56.850
Neither do I!

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:11.990
Aaaaaah! {They shout their gobi, so idk}

00:11:26.960 --> 00:11:28.340
Amnesia?

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:29.820
Yeah...

00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:33.250
He was injured, too, so I couldn't leave him be.

00:11:33.840 --> 00:11:35.540
That's very like you.

00:11:35.530 --> 00:11:38.370
But we don't know when he'll strike!

00:11:38.370 --> 00:11:40.750
Yes, he's dangerous.

00:11:41.190 --> 00:11:42.860
I know he is...

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:44.080
You're being naive.

00:11:44.510 --> 00:11:46.310
Cure Ace!

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:50.220
If leaving him be makes the worst come to pass,

00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:52.320
will you face the consequences?

00:11:53.760 --> 00:11:56.800
An injured enemy is an enemy all the same.

00:11:56.790 --> 00:11:58.080
Evil is evil.

00:11:59.030 --> 00:11:59.820
Ai.

00:12:01.470 --> 00:12:04.310
Precure Dress Up!

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:06.470
Kyupirappa!

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:53.490
Love's trump card,

00:12:53.490 --> 00:12:54.910
Cure Ace!

00:13:11.280 --> 00:13:12.540
She transformed!

00:13:15.330 --> 00:13:16.680
What are you thinking?

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:17.720
Rikka...

00:13:18.210 --> 00:13:20.450
Should he heal and his memories return,

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:23.680
he shall certainly return to oppose us once more.

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:26.260
If so, then now is the time...

00:13:26.250 --> 00:13:27.590
Stop it!

00:13:40.940 --> 00:13:42.030
I'll ask once. Move.

00:13:44.790 --> 00:13:45.570
Move!

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:46.800
No!

00:13:47.280 --> 00:13:49.500
He's committed many crimes before.

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:51.570
You've not forgotten, have you?

00:13:51.570 --> 00:13:53.470
Of course I remember.

00:13:54.090 --> 00:13:54.810
But...

00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:59.370
if someone's injured and in pain, then no matter who it is,

00:13:59.370 --> 00:14:01.660
I want to help them!

00:14:01.660 --> 00:14:03.790
I know I'd regret it otherwise!

00:14:04.150 --> 00:14:07.330
I don't want to live with regrets!

00:14:07.330 --> 00:14:09.760
I'll trust in my beliefs!

00:14:11.700 --> 00:14:13.160
Do you agree?

00:14:15.110 --> 00:14:16.190
Rachel!

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:20.370
To be honest, I think you're right!

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:21.300
But still!

00:14:21.300 --> 00:14:23.770
I'm going to trust Rikka!

00:14:24.190 --> 00:14:25.180
Rachel...

00:14:26.490 --> 00:14:28.480
I don't fully agree, but still...

00:14:28.750 --> 00:14:29.970
Girls!

00:14:29.970 --> 00:14:32.670
I feel the same as Rachel.

00:14:35.370 --> 00:14:37.550
Found ya, Precures!

00:14:41.280 --> 00:14:45.130
Cure Diamond, show me the lengths you'll go to for your beliefs.

00:14:46.330 --> 00:14:47.300
Huh?

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:55.470
Are you okay?

00:14:55.470 --> 00:14:56.130
Yeah...

00:14:56.130 --> 00:14:57.340
Good...

00:14:57.340 --> 00:14:59.070
It's dangerous, so stay back!

00:14:59.070 --> 00:15:00.040
Girls!

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:02.810
Rachel!

00:15:04.030 --> 00:15:06.750
Precure Love Link!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:07.840
L-O-V-E!

00:15:07.840 --> 00:15:08.520
L-O-V-E!

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:09.150
L-O-V-E!

00:15:09.150 --> 00:15:10.370
L-O-V-E!

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:28.350
Brimming with love,

00:15:29.110 --> 00:15:30.490
Cure Heart!

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:34.810
The light of wisdom,

00:15:35.810 --> 00:15:37.270
Cure Diamond!

00:15:39.690 --> 00:15:41.470
The warmth of the sun,

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:43.700
Cure Rosetta!

00:15:45.270 --> 00:15:46.680
The blade of courage,

00:15:47.450 --> 00:15:48.740
Cure Sword!

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:54.450
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.150
Dokidoki Precure!

00:15:58.060 --> 00:16:00.370
Rikka... transformed too?

00:16:01.340 --> 00:16:02.840
Wow...

00:16:02.840 --> 00:16:06.800
She's blue, feathery, and glistening...

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:10.650
W-What?

00:16:11.070 --> 00:16:13.350
Oh poor Selfish who has lost his love,

00:16:13.930 --> 00:16:15.520
I, Cure Heart,

00:16:15.520 --> 00:16:18.950
will make your heart race once more!

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.690
Pre... cure?

00:16:24.690 --> 00:16:28.430
Then I'll take a bite outta your hearts!

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:41.010
What? What in the...

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:56.320
Ira, what're you standin' around for?

00:16:56.880 --> 00:16:58.130
Ira?

00:17:06.830 --> 00:17:08.950
Get hit for all I care!

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:10.100
Run!

00:17:18.950 --> 00:17:19.650
Huh?

00:17:20.150 --> 00:17:22.530
What the heck're you tryin' to pull?!

00:17:23.530 --> 00:17:25.380
The one who will defeat the Precures...

00:17:26.760 --> 00:17:28.190
will be me!

00:17:28.470 --> 00:17:29.410
Could it be?

00:17:29.410 --> 00:17:30.520
His memories...

00:17:33.610 --> 00:17:34.530
I see...

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:36.640
Good.

00:17:37.820 --> 00:17:39.970
W-Why are you smiling?

00:17:39.970 --> 00:17:41.100
You crazy girl.

00:17:41.450 --> 00:17:44.380
Well, I'm happy.

00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:48.840
This must be how I truly feel.

00:17:48.840 --> 00:17:50.610
Stay out of this, Ira!

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:53.920
Take this, Precures!

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.740
I didn't ask for your help!

00:17:58.740 --> 00:18:00.530
Oops, my bad.

00:18:00.520 --> 00:18:01.320
Huh?

00:18:01.730 --> 00:18:04.270
<i>Did he actually help us?</i>

00:18:11.870 --> 00:18:15.480
You've shown me your true feelings.

00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:20.040
The Precure's Five Vows! {Just stretch this line out to include the 一つ. Nobody will notice a thing. ( ´∀`)}

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:24.820
A Precure must trust herself and never regret her actions!

00:18:25.630 --> 00:18:27.120
<i>Then, what she did before...</i>

00:18:28.280 --> 00:18:31.130
<i>was an act to make me face my true feelings?</i>

00:18:34.760 --> 00:18:36.710
Thank you, Cure Ace.

00:18:36.710 --> 00:18:38.270
For what, I wonder?

00:18:48.430 --> 00:18:50.910
Oh mild mannered glutton,

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:53.680
I, Cure Diamond,

00:18:53.680 --> 00:18:56.090
shall cool your hot head down! {I was hoping I'd never have to use this line again and could afford to keep the awkward translation dead and buried. (´；ω；`)}

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.890
Cure Diamond!

00:18:57.890 --> 00:19:00.810
Now is the time to fight alongside me!

00:19:01.190 --> 00:19:02.320
Beautify!

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:04.740
Love Kiss Rouge!

00:19:13.740 --> 00:19:15.130
Your heart shall go aflutter!

00:19:15.130 --> 00:19:16.510
Ace Shot!

00:19:16.510 --> 00:19:17.930
Bang!

00:19:23.040 --> 00:19:25.240
What the heck?

00:19:25.590 --> 00:19:27.180
Love Heart Arrow!

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:37.920
Precure Diamond Shower!

00:19:43.290 --> 00:19:46.220
Shaved ice is my favorite food!

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:49.600
That's... surprising.

00:19:49.600 --> 00:19:51.330
But if you overeat...

00:19:55.930 --> 00:19:56.980
How 'bout that?

00:19:56.980 --> 00:19:58.250
Glad you enjoyed it.

00:19:58.650 --> 00:20:01.950
By the way, is your head cooled?

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:03.040
Huh?

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:08.090
Ugh, brain freeze! I ate too much ice!

00:20:08.090 --> 00:20:10.310
Drat! I'll remember this!

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:16.540
Looks like you've finally powered up, Diamond!

00:20:16.540 --> 00:20:18.140
That was impressive!

00:20:18.140 --> 00:20:19.900
We didn't get a chance to step in. {Or screentime. We should keep it this way.}

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:21.960
I knew you could do it!

00:20:21.960 --> 00:20:23.510
Thanks, Rachel.

00:20:24.950 --> 00:20:27.560
Excellent work, Cure Diamond.

00:20:27.560 --> 00:20:29.590
But you must not lower your guard.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:31.910
Around Ira, that is.

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:35.880
I'm certain that the next time he appears...

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:38.360
Yes, I'm aware.

00:20:39.140 --> 00:20:41.300
Then I bid you adieu.

00:21:16.840 --> 00:21:19.900
Hey, coming home safe is what counts!

00:21:20.240 --> 00:21:23.370
That's fine, but what kind of souvenirs are these?

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:25.520
I got those from the natives.

00:21:25.520 --> 00:21:29.340
They say they're charms that will make your dreams come true.

00:21:29.340 --> 00:21:31.830
I see. Thanks, Daddy.

00:21:31.830 --> 00:21:33.780
But this is great timing.

00:21:34.180 --> 00:21:34.980
For what?

00:21:36.270 --> 00:21:38.870
It's a bit embarrassing to say it again,

00:21:38.870 --> 00:21:40.950
but I know what I want to be.

00:21:41.320 --> 00:21:44.150
You do? Wasn't it a doctor?

00:21:44.140 --> 00:21:47.750
Yeah! I want to be a doctor.

00:21:47.750 --> 00:21:49.120
It's just...

00:21:49.630 --> 00:21:53.600
up until now, I wasn't fully prepared for it.

00:21:54.690 --> 00:21:56.110
Something made you?

00:22:04.520 --> 00:22:04.560
{ED}

00:22:07.310 --> 00:22:09.670
A Precure must be a first class lady!

00:22:09.670 --> 00:22:10.780
L-Lady?

00:22:10.780 --> 00:22:15.310
As such, I invite you all to join me in an outdoor tea ceremony! {ということで今度開かれる野点の席に皆さんをご招待いたしますわ。}

00:22:15.310 --> 00:22:17.450
We shall go all out and drill some manners into Mana's head! {びしばしマナを叩き込んで差し上げます。}

00:22:17.850 --> 00:22:19.050
What's a tea ceremony?

00:22:19.050 --> 00:22:20.220
It's the meaning of the Way of Tea. {茶道の意思ですわ。}

00:22:20.690 --> 00:22:21.890
It's quite fun!

00:22:22.290 --> 00:22:26.390
Aguri, you said we'd go all out, but is it actually fun?

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:28.890
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:31.830
It's Out of the Bag?!

00:22:28.890 --> 00:22:31.830
It's Out of the Bag?!

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:34.000
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
